{"id":"validation-v1-h264-01","codecs":["h264"],"topic":"luma-fractional-interpolation","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"avc-luma-fractional-interpolation-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.264 亮度运动补偿中，考虑同一水平线上整数位置 G、半像素 b 和位于两者之间的四分之一像素 a。b 的滤波中间量 b1 和可用于四分之一像素平均的 b 有什么区别？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"b1 是水平六抽头滤波的未归一化中间量。对它加 16、右移 5 位并裁剪到亮度样本范围后，才得到半像素样本 b。a 用整数样本 G 和已处理的 b 做向上舍入平均；不能用 b1 或未裁剪的半像素值替代 b。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":197},"snippet_sha256":"4c84bb13e3b49d11effa4b83203e0c11ccc5b84e39325eaee94168c01adcdc6c"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
{"id":"validation-v1-h264-02","codecs":["h264"],"topic":"luma-fractional-interpolation","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"avc-luma-fractional-interpolation-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"按 H.264 的水平亮度分数像素规则，8-bit 输入的六个整数样本 E,F,G,H,I,J 依次为 0,0,240,255,0,0。求半像素 b 及 G 与 b 之间的四分之一像素 a。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 half_b、quarter_a。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"六抽头中间量是 20×240+20×255=9900；加 16 右移 5 位得 309，再裁剪为 b=255。a=(240+255+1)>>1=248。计算 a 用的是裁剪后的 b。\n{\"half_b\":255,\"quarter_a\":248}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":197},"snippet_sha256":"4c84bb13e3b49d11effa4b83203e0c11ccc5b84e39325eaee94168c01adcdc6c"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
{"id":"validation-v1-h265-01","codecs":["h265"],"topic":"ctb-tile-address","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"hevc-ctb-tile-address-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"HEVC 启用 tiles 时，CTB 的全图栅格地址和 tile-scan 地址为什么可能不同？slice_segment_address 以哪一种地址表示 slice segment 的首个 CTB？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"全图栅格扫描直接逐行经过整幅图；tile scan 先按 tile 的行列顺序遍历 tile，再在每个 tile 内逐行遍历 CTB。一个 tile 跨多行时通常会改变地址顺序。slice_segment_address 表示首个 CTB 的全图栅格地址，进入按 tile 扫描的处理前可用 CtbAddrRsToTs 转换。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":46},"snippet_sha256":"e9de92b9c5122dc29f2e605a96d8fa17ef7b26a53d8d88e2c17f8216e7c26c61"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":47},"snippet_sha256":"bef808755926b59852eb8ad0da0a42bce2a0eeb02bab7517d515e0b6fc6396b2"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":113},"snippet_sha256":"e19333f0fda7d7d516b0a863d7f29f902ba48e6e385cf6886aae52542fbcb0e3"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
{"id":"validation-v1-h265-02","codecs":["h265"],"topic":"ctb-tile-address","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"hevc-ctb-tile-address-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"HEVC 图片的 CTB 网格为 5×3（宽×高）。两列 tile 的 CTB 宽分别为 2、3，两行 tile 的 CTB 高分别为 1、2。地址均从 0 开始。求全图栅格地址 RS=10 对应的 TS，以及 TS=11 对应的 RS。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 ts_for_rs、rs_for_ts。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"按 tile 逐个列出其中的 RS，依次为 [0,1]、[2,3,4]、[5,6,10,11]、[7,8,9,12,13,14]。把这些块连接起来，RS=10 位于 TS=7；TS=11 处的 RS 是 9。\n{\"ts_for_rs\":7,\"rs_for_ts\":9}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":46},"snippet_sha256":"e9de92b9c5122dc29f2e605a96d8fa17ef7b26a53d8d88e2c17f8216e7c26c61"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":47},"snippet_sha256":"bef808755926b59852eb8ad0da0a42bce2a0eeb02bab7517d515e0b6fc6396b2"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
{"id":"validation-v1-h266-01","codecs":["h266"],"topic":"subpicture-boundary","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"vvc-subpicture-boundary-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"在 H.266 的 SPS 中，sps_independent_subpics_flag=0，并且某子图的 sps_subpic_treated_as_pic_flag=1、sps_loop_filter_across_subpic_enabled_flag=1。为什么后两个标志并不矛盾？可以由此断定所有边界都会实际滤波吗？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"第一个子图标志让解码在环路滤波以外的处理里将该子图视为图片。跨子图环路滤波由另一个标志控制，值为 1 表示允许跨界；是否在某个位置真正滤波还由对应滤波工具与边界条件决定。序列的 independent 标志为 0，本身没有施加禁止跨界的独立约束。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":120},"snippet_sha256":"058a325317ea6ae0857394045facf1d53bf8d7ec6bf59a155b129cd38777b572"},{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":121},"snippet_sha256":"0c6095852b0b7e48dca70b9db023fbd958a812d8d0da430afa3160e45121f33a"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
{"id":"validation-v1-h266-02","codecs":["h266"],"topic":"subpicture-boundary","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"vvc-subpicture-boundary-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.266 中已经有多个合法子图，SPS 的 sps_independent_subpics_flag=1。对任一子图，推断 sps_subpic_treated_as_pic_flag 与 sps_loop_filter_across_subpic_enabled_flag 的值，并说明是否显式读取。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 treated_as_pic、cross_loop_filter。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"独立子图的分支不显式读取这两个逐子图标志。treated-as-picture 缺省推断为 1，跨子图环路滤波标志推断为 0；因此按图片边界处理子图，且不跨子图边界滤波。\n{\"treated_as_pic\":1,\"cross_loop_filter\":0}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":55},"snippet_sha256":"dded193e75a2b8b11b17eccbcc6bb99f705426c74221be8afa328be551f002c5"},{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":120},"snippet_sha256":"058a325317ea6ae0857394045facf1d53bf8d7ec6bf59a155b129cd38777b572"},{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":121},"snippet_sha256":"0c6095852b0b7e48dca70b9db023fbd958a812d8d0da430afa3160e45121f33a"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
{"id":"validation-v1-av1-01","codecs":["av1"],"topic":"film-grain-parameter-reuse","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"av1-film-grain-parameter-reuse-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"AV1 的 film_grain_params_present=1，但当前帧 show_frame=0 且 showable_frame=0。进入 film_grain_params() 后会继续读取 apply_grain 和 grain_seed 吗？为什么？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"不会。即使序列允许胶片颗粒参数，只要当前帧既不显示也不可显示，这个过程就在开头重置颗粒参数并返回。apply_grain 和 grain_seed 位于这个提前返回之后，不会在该分支读取。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":69},"snippet_sha256":"cfc6f2f25d5efe992f62004008c357ecb9826957162d43613be9b0a7c76b587b"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
{"id":"validation-v1-av1-02","codecs":["av1"],"topic":"film-grain-parameter-reuse","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"av1-film-grain-parameter-reuse-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"AV1 的当前 INTER_FRAME 已进入胶片颗粒参数读取路径，apply_grain=1，读到当前 grain_seed=321、update_grain=0，film_grain_params_ref_idx 指向合法参考帧，其 grain_seed=900。复用后当前 grain_seed 是多少？说明保存和恢复的顺序。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 grain_seed。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"当前种子仍是 321。先临时保存当前刚读到的 grain_seed，再加载指定参考帧的颗粒参数，最后把保存的当前种子恢复，随后返回。复用参考参数不意味着保留参考种子 900。\n{\"grain_seed\":321}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":69},"snippet_sha256":"cfc6f2f25d5efe992f62004008c357ecb9826957162d43613be9b0a7c76b587b"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"validation-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/README.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/validation-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"仅用于验证集，来源与适用条件已核对，待独立领域复核。"}}
